  <title xml:lang="EN">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Harnessing Property Rights in Greater Busia Metro, 2025-2028</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="2" xml:lang="EN">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The objective of the project is to improve local economic development in the Greater Busia Metro (GBM) by improving the governance of land and property rights, especially for informal women and youth traders.  The project aims to assess the complex interplay of housing, land, and property rights in East African border towns of Busia, exploring the challenges</narrative>
  </description>
